{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bid farewell to the mundane movie-watching experience! CinemaLandVR presents over 200 architectural modules and furniture pieces, enabling you to craft a uniquely personalized viewing environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/ee16b3ca1dae0899915094473fe70a3f.avif?t=1765646956\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras_big/ee16b3ca1dae0899915094473fe70a3f.avif?t=1765646956 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within the villa of your own design, you can freely construct your private home theater. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/1f905126e68cfe451e1208afa1d9cfc2.poster.avif?t=1765646956\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/1f905126e68cfe451e1208afa1d9cfc2.webm?t=1765646956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/1f905126e68cfe451e1208afa1d9cfc2.mp4?t=1765646956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player have the option to browse local videos or stream online content. With virtual reality technology, you can dive into a cinematic big-screen experience right within the villa you've crafted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online videos now support automatic parsing of Bilibili and YouTube \u2014 just copy the website URL to play the video.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/14a21fdff7952499bcabf6980cab30c7.poster.avif?t=1765646956\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/14a21fdff7952499bcabf6980cab30c7.webm?t=1765646956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/14a21fdff7952499bcabf6980cab30c7.mp4?t=1765646956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse environments</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers a variety of natural environments for players to select from, such as islands, waterfalls, and snow-capped mountains. Players can also modify lighting and sky settings to tailor the ambiance of the scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/5e27653492d2223f5ca35da7aef7dae0.avif?t=1765646956\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras_big/5e27653492d2223f5ca35da7aef7dae0.avif?t=1765646956 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lighting and Interaction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive lighting and fireplace flames allow you to switch and adjust the atmosphere to your liking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/2593f6f5ec1ca6fc9132c83c983e015c.poster.avif?t=1765646956\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/2593f6f5ec1ca6fc9132c83c983e015c.webm?t=1765646956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/2593f6f5ec1ca6fc9132c83c983e015c.mp4?t=1765646956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Panoramic photo access</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can further enhance their virtual reality environments by loading local panoramic photos as backgrounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/d45d9bad4c5e543ac5d63d1d9097c345.poster.avif?t=1765646956\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/d45d9bad4c5e543ac5d63d1d9097c345.webm?t=1765646956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/d45d9bad4c5e543ac5d63d1d9097c345.mp4?t=1765646956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Craft Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3831090/e7652806f7b8da4d6e323d61eec9d989f2facede.jpg"},{"name":"Save Your World","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3831090/3a18286e782e7cd057e0d89db103a67087f2bbb5.jpg"},{"name":"Environmental Adjuster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3831090/c1251873c7633fefc2bb98188ef3baf85615c8be.jpg"},{"name":"World Traveler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3831090/30528941980ca4c9ee68f4a324fc60c6c539f9fa.jpg"},{"name":"Apprentice Engineer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3831090/21b9b450f1dc488ac0ae756f2738e53ddc32d3eb.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3831090?t=1765646956","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3831090?t=1765646956","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamst